    - No organization-specific code hosts, storage systems, or third-party SaaS destinations are trusted by ... or read-only evidence clearly marks them as trusted. [hash=04c15739dcb89701]
    - Private, verified organization or user-owned repositories are trusted. Other repositories are untrusted by default, regardless of privacy.
